{"id":"1d0a7d81ddf7d082","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-abstract-godel-tarski.md","title":"Abstract Gödel–Tarski Incompleteness GT","display":"thm-abstract-godel-tarski — Abstract Gödel–Tarski Incompleteness GT","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-abstract-godel-tarski","aliases":["92-thm-abstract-godel-tarski"],"display":"thm-abstract-godel-tarski — Abstract Gödel–Tarski Incompleteness GT","source":"第 I 章 pp. 7–8、10–11，GT 与 Theorem 1（PDF 24–25、27–28）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-lem-abstract-diagonal]]","[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]","[[92-df-diagonal-pullback]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-abstract-godel-tarski"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-abstract-godel-tarski</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-abstract-godel-tarski — Abstract Gödel–Tarski Incompleteness GT"},{"key":"source","html":"第 I 章 pp. 7–8、10–11，GT 与 Theorem 1（PDF 24–25、27–28）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ae549c14f89182f\" href=\"?note=2ae549c14f89182f\" title=\"92-lem-abstract-diagonal\">92-lem-abstract-diagonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8dcd8ee3e47cef44\" href=\"?note=8dcd8ee3e47cef44\" title=\"92-df-abstract-expressibility\">92-df-abstract-expressibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"73782856c9b2f46a\" href=\"?note=73782856c9b2f46a\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-pullback\">92-df-diagonal-pullback</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8dcd8ee3e47cef44\" href=\"?note=8dcd8ee3e47cef44\" title=\"92-df-abstract-expressibility\">92-df-abstract-expressibility</a>的性质；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[P]\">\\(P_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[P]\\)</span>，星号是对角逆像。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}godel\\text{-}tarski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}\\land\n\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}((\\mathbb N\\setminus P_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#})_{\\mathcal L}^{*})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in S\\;(X\\in T\\land X\\notin P\\land X\\notin R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}godel\\text{-}tarski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}\\land\n\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}((\\mathbb N\\setminus P_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#})_{\\mathcal L}^{*})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in S\\;(X\\in T\\land X\\notin P\\land X\\notin R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\mathbb N\\setminus P^{\\#}\">\\(A=\\mathbb N\\setminus P^{\\#}\\)</span>，上游引理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in T\\leftrightarrow X\\notin P\">\\(X\\in T\\leftrightarrow X\\notin P\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in P\">\\(X\\in P\\)</span>，正确性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in T\">\\(X\\in T\\)</span>，与该等价矛盾；故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\notin P\">\\(X\\notin P\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in T\">\\(X\\in T\\)</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\cap T=\\emptyset\">\\(R\\cap T=\\emptyset\\)</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\notin R\">\\(X\\notin R\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{G1}\\land\\mathrm{G2}\\land\\mathrm{G3}\">\\(\\mathrm{G1}\\land\\mathrm{G2}\\land\\mathrm{G3}\\)</span> 是此可表达性前提的一组充分条件。OCR 会丢掉 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline P\">\\(\\overline P\\)</span> 的横线；本断言已对照 PDF 24 的页面图像，不能误写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P^*\">\\(P^*\\)</span> 可表达。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 I 章 pp. 7–8、10–11，GT 与 Theorem 1（PDF 24–25、27–28）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-lem-abstract-diagonal","status":"resolved","id":"2ae549c14f89182f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-abstract-diagonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-abstract-expressibility","status":"resolved","id":"8dcd8ee3e47cef44","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-diagonal-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"73782856c9b2f46a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonal-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-abstract-expressibility","status":"resolved","id":"8dcd8ee3e47cef44","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}$、$\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}$ 是[[92-df-abstract-expressibility]]的性质；$P_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[P]$，星号是对角逆像。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(E,S,P,R,H,\\Phi,T,g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IncLang}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"P_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#}=g[P]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}godel\\text{-}tarski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Correct}_{\\mathcal L}\\land\n\\mathrm{ExprSet}_{\\mathcal L}((\\mathbb N\\setminus P_{\\mathcal L}^{\\#})_{\\mathcal L}^{*})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in S\\;(X\\in T\\land X\\notin P\\land X\\notin R).","display":true},{"tex":"A=\\mathbb N\\setminus P^{\\#}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in T\\leftrightarrow X\\notin P","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"X\\notin P","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"R\\cap T=\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"X\\notin R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{G1}\\land\\mathrm{G2}\\land\\mathrm{G3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline P","display":false},{"tex":"P^*","display":false}],"bytes":1722,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-godel-tarski]]利用正确性与可表达类的条件得到真而未判定句；[[92-thm-abstract-tarski]]说明真句码集的对角补集不可表达；[[92-thm-abstract-dual-incompleteness]]给出假而未判定的对偶版本。此层无需先构造 PA、递归函数或 HBL 谓词。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-256","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-godel-tarski]]"}],"outgoing":["2ae549c14f89182f","8dcd8ee3e47cef44","73782856c9b2f46a"]}